  "content": "\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em style=\"font-weight:400\"><img src=\"https://cdn.chrisarrived.com/mw/mod-pages/HelpyBanner.png\" width=\"1800\" height=\"650\"></em></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-family:&amp;#x27\">歡迎來到 Five</span><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"> Nights at Freddy&rsquo;s: Management Wanted！</span></span></h1>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;font-size:24px\"><span><span><iframe style=\"width:693px\" src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/_dMd8RiPD2Q?lc=UgxkkZmYzRmtQCIXdYl4AaABAg\" width=\"630\" height=\"426\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span><br></span></span></h1>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://cdn.chrisarrived.com/mw/mod-pages/manage.gif\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"><br></span></p>\n<h2 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#999\">&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>《Five Nights at Freddy&rsquo;s: Management Wanted》是一款 Minecraft 模組，融合了《Freddy Fazbear&rsquo;s Pizzeria Simulator》(FFPS) 的披薩店經營機制與《FNaF World》的 RPG 冒險元素。</strong></span></span></h2>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://cdn.arrival.studio/mw/mod-pages/customize.gif\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27;color:#999\">踏入法茲熊管理模擬器！學習如何透過電腦經營一家成功的披薩店！</span></strong></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#999;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>設計、建造並維護&nbsp;</strong>你自己的餐廳！&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#999;font-family:&amp;#x27\"><strong>客製化</strong>你的披薩店，搭配<strong>獨特的裝飾與機械玩偶！&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#999;font-family:&amp;#x27\">從超過&nbsp;<strong>150 種機械玩偶中挑選！&nbsp;</strong>&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#999\"><img src=\"https://cdn.chrisarrived.com/mw/mod-pages/survive.gif\" width=\"1126\" height=\"176\"></span></p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;color:#999\"><strong>夜晚嚴苛不饒人，保持警覺並善用所有可用工具，堅持到早上 6 點！</strong></span></span></h1>\n<ul>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#999;font-family:&amp;#x27\">監控&nbsp;<a style=\"color:#999\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surveillance-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">安全攝影機</a>，追蹤這些機械威脅的動向！&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"color:#999;font-family:&amp;#x27\">利用門、燈光、面具和聲音誘餌將怪物拒於門外！&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li style=\"text-align:left\"><span style=\"font-family:&amp;#x27\"><span style=\"color:#999\">為了你的安全，請保持冷靜並與它們保持距離。</span>&nbsp;</span></li>\n</ul>\n<hr>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>相關模組與社群</strong></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em><strong>（點擊圖片以在新分頁中開啟連結）</strong></em></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a style=\"background-color:rgb(13, 13, 13);font-family:Lato, &amp;#x27;font-weight:400;color:#e5e5e5\" href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/management-wanted-more-decor\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1027040/description_28102e83-04fd-482c-9529-fee7c50ffd8e.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"800\" height=\"289\"></a><a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/surveillance-package\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.chrisarrived.com/mw/mod-pages/SP-banner.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"1920\" height=\"600\"></a></p>\n<p><a href=\"https://discord.gg/ovdr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.chrisarrived.com/mw/mod-pages/discord-btn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"59\"></a> &nbsp;&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/@ManagementWanted\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.chrisarrived.com/mw/mod-pages/youtube-btn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"59\"></a>&nbsp; &nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/geckolib\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.chrisarrived.com/mw/mod-pages/geckolib-btn.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"263\" height=\"59\"></a></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><br>🎧支持我們的音樂創作者，點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmwsound.team%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong>聆聽我們的音樂！🎧</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">🤝 在這裡觀看玩家為我們的模組製作的影片 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252ffnafmw.com%252fplaylists%252fcommunity\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>這裡！</strong></span></a> <em>（我們很喜歡看大家的創作！:D）</em>🤝</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">🐦 追蹤我們的<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fx.com%252fintent%252ffollow%253fscreen_name%253dfnafmw\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Twitter</a></strong> 與<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fdiscord.com%252finvite%252fovdr\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Discord</a></strong>，掌握 FNAF:MW 的一切最新消息！🟪&nbsp;<br><br></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">由 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fovdrstudios.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">OVDR Studios</a> 製作 | 點擊<strong><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fovdr.org%252fdonate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">這裡</a></strong>支持我們，獲取專屬福利！</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><em>FNAF: Management Wanted 與 Scott Cawthon 或 Steel Wool Studios 無關。</em><br><br></p>\n<hr>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;</p>",
